{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8821a449f3a4d91b384d522c0a9044a50ce3207179ca5462d15c75d4312e144d","ja":"新CMの演技プラン","zh":"新广告的表演构思","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1ef45fcec3d02759f7b5590bec2227e8788805622018be9694d04e740bf4bbee","ja":"先日コラボした製菓会社から、ホワイトデー用の\nCM撮影の依頼があった。その撮影当日……","zh":"之前合作过的糕点公司发来了白色情人节用\n广告拍摄的委托。到了拍摄当天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"199b875ee577b7565c779964e63e554f5cc01fe73c732689fabc49772816658a","ja":"えへへ、チョコの会社だし、\n撮影頑張ったらチョコもらえるかな？","zh":"嘿嘿，既然是巧克力公司，\n拍摄努力点的话，能拿到巧克力吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c519410f016e19543b886741670688b774d25ba5696cd857b161fb96b8aa7338","ja":"ふふ、だといいね♪　難しい内容だし、\n認めてもらえるように頑張らないとだよね。","zh":"呵呵，要是能那样就好了♪ 内容确实挺难的，\n为了能得到认可，必须得努力才行呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"16a5f21787349631fb296c2932230478faba083f14930934c28498170cb63e6b","ja":"特に、『好きな人』からバレンタインのお返しを\nもらうシーンなんて、すごく緊張しちゃいそう……。","zh":"特别是从“喜欢的人”那里收到情人节回礼的\n场景，感觉会非常紧张呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cf0a13f0273f3c4c92c8e31ca248d62ea38ae79b459e052238b28280615061e9","ja":"うん、ドキドキしちゃうよね！\nでも、見てくれた人にもドキドキしてほしいな！","zh":"嗯，会让人心跳加速呢！\n不过，我也想让看的人心跳加速呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"dbbcf951d9cfb3a479075ae4d708221f47925b2891b7d7b9c43c0dcecbfb3779","ja":"恋愛のドキドキを感じてもらえるといいよね！\nけど、ライブとも違うし、どんな感じがいいかな～？","zh":"要是能让大家感受到恋爱的怦然心动就好了呢！\n不过，这又和演唱会不一样，怎样会比较好呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"fe8e994fe7486d95cab213b7bc9760ddda265288afca2d36cb57b68251db348b","ja":"茜ちゃんは余裕だよ～！　プレゼントもらうの\n日常茶飯事だから、お礼も自然に言えちゃうからね！","zh":"小茜游刃有余哦～！毕竟收礼物都是\n家常便饭了，道谢也是张口就来呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e9cd5196bca8e4ce86ca8ec7073170e969ac8a603eff9f2482d89b01d92cba9a","ja":"好きな人から？　さっすが～！\n茜の撮影、お手本にさせてもらうねっ！","zh":"是喜欢的人送的？真不愧是你～！\n那茜的拍摄就拿来当参考啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"29b74ab6b70ad133c9db9e0aef03a115ce3526359f64a2d2a86a4072d8873a56","ja":"う……うん。も、もちろんだよ！\nキュートに決めてみせるからね！","zh":"嗯……嗯。当、当然啦！\n我会表现得非常可爱的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"a1deee450173e116b7034235809d52c282677885672ba7ecf85ae3675d7f0dfe","ja":"キュートか……。\n私も参考にさせてもらうね！","zh":"可爱吗……\n我也要参考一下呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"44cee47fcda6d6af1f8a8f35bc1b0b0043ab680d043947b5cf49956cd0b71019","ja":"紗代子さんは、カメラの向こうの\n『好きな人』、イメージできてるの？","zh":"纱代子小姐，镜头另一边\n那个“喜欢的人”，你能想象得出来吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"880fbd79dba424667ea583cd1b638829f45758a9e9b5d361f0513796057af0a7","ja":"それはこれから！\n具体的に誰かイメージできればいいんだけど……。","zh":"那还得看之后！\n要是能具体想象出是谁就好了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"5a28a69cfbfc965fe9a6d41c46c065a1fb88de1e749533416905964c4b0aa749","ja":"誰にするか、ってこと？\nホワイトデーだし、それなら私は……。","zh":"是在问选谁，对吧？\n既然是白色情人节，那我就……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"8a426ef92e3af40fffb1a2ac0b736e7ea6c76050d4fa20da20e76c1939538ba5","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーさんかな！","zh":"●●●●制作人吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1005.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"c7a53d128a6114e1bca27af37a01b5092e233a4dd035b5eb34b0e191a9e1902e","ja":"……えっ！？","zh":"……诶！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
